{"4835760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms: Splatter", "steam_appid": 4835760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4860300], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew are stranded deep in the endless, humming halls of the Backrooms. Buzzing lights, empty yellow corridors, sterile archives, bottomless chasms — and the only way forward is paint. Spray it, splash it, and watch the dead world light up under your color. It's eerie, it's weird, it's strangely beautiful... and it's pure chaos with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835760/extras/eee2900a0db9ffbcf147e9fa87b62583.poster.avif?t=1781809431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835760/extras/eee2900a0db9ffbcf147e9fa87b62583.webm?t=1781809431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835760/extras/eee2900a0db9ffbcf147e9fa87b62583.mp4?t=1781809431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎨 Paint everything — Cover walls, floors, ceilings and props in vivid color. Your tank runs dry, so spray smart and grab refills as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 1–4 player online co-op — Play solo or squad up. Everyone gets their own colored suit: 🟢 green, 🟡 yellow, 🔴 red, 🟣 purple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 Paint to progress — Reveal hidden bridges over deadly drops, fill paint trails and color secret panels to open the way. The level only makes sense once you've painted it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👻 Backrooms, but fun — Classic liminal dread turned into a color-soaked playground full of weird anomalies and &quot;what was that?&quot; moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏚️ Explore strange worlds — From the first eerie halls to a colorful archive wing and out across the Chasm Walk, where you paint invisible bridges into existence step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎙️ Talk it out — Built-in voice chat: shout directions, scream at a missed jump, and coordinate the next splatter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚪 Jump in fast — Host a room, browse open games, or join by code in seconds, then dive into the void together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835760/extras/15b6b70d83ddeaeee76f8f336a555cb6.poster.avif?t=1781809431\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835760/extras/15b6b70d83ddeaeee76f8f336a555cb6.webm?t=1781809431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4835760/extras/15b6b70d83ddeaeee76f8f336a555cb6.mp4?t=1781809431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will you escape the void — or just make it prettier?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab three friends, load up, and paint your way to freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🟢🟡🔴🟣 Wishlist Backrooms: Splatter now.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew are stranded deep in the endless, humming halls of the Backrooms. Buzzing lights, empty yellow corridors, sterile archives, bottomless chasms — and the only way forward is paint. Spray it, splash it, and watch the dead world light up under your color. It's eerie, it's weird, it's strangely beautiful... and it's pure chaos with friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto